Children of Isis Scenario
Difficulty : 10
Bonus : 100
--------------------------------------------------------------
Your people, although at peace, are under the age-old threat from the fabled Fryhtans.  These beings, if the stories are true, come pouring out of the Unknown Lands and slaughter the inhabitants of any unprotected Town.
You must resist these beings in any way that you can.  Your goal is to build a population of 200 within seven years.  It is highly unlikely that you will be able to do this without the aid of your great Goddess Isis.

